"夕張 花月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93955","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25081"],"vndbCharacterId":"c8168"},"originalCharacterName":"夕張 花月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる館の侍女で、奇人病患者の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"侍女の中で最年少。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだまだ幼い、舌足らずな甘えん坊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"涙腺がゆるく、嬉しいときも、悲しいときも、すぐに涙を流す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は日記で、その内容を信頼する他の仲間たちにも絶対に見せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その奇病による性欲の疼きは、未成熟な肉体にも容赦なく、彼女を困惑させる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25081","sourceWorkId":"7720","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の侍女で、奇人病患者の1人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えん坊で舌足らず。直ぐに涙を流すがそれが嬉し涙の時もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部屋は書き溜めた日記で埋まっており、信頼している彩江や仲間にも決して読ませようとはしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分ひとりでは奇人病が克服できない事を良く知っており、健次や彩江に庇護を求める。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93955"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f088a46ad7f4174ee931c3efa24262913b5b6e131d9187fa2b8487d7f7f27120.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a86dce3db07a9bbddd13b743e1ad28ef3cb5538d39df8556048fc64db8bac351.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前川優子","creatorId":"vndb:s1064","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1064","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1064","name":"前川 優子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:68258:93955:6321:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"生方 メゾン","creatorId":"vndb:s5815","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5815","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5815","name":"生方 メゾン","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3649","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c8169","characterName":"白石 香菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93956","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68258"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25082"],"vndbCharacterId":"c8169"},"originalCharacterName":"白石 香菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる館の侍女で、奇人病患者の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様育ちのためか、性格は穏やかでおっとりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、得たいの知らない病のため、時折、その不安が表情を曇らせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"余命が幾ばくであること知った彼女は、憧れていた家族という絆を欲し、主人公に子供が欲しいと強請り……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25082","sourceWorkId":"7720","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の侍女で、奇人病患者の1人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様育ちのため、穏やかでスローテンポな性格をしている。しかし「奇人病」という得体の知れない病気のため、不安が表面に出てくる事もしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彩江を母親と慕い、家族に憧れている。健次と彩江が結ばれる事を望んでいるが、余命が限られている事を知った今、直接健次の子供を欲しがっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93956"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d079c079a7ddb2044c51ab2baa7e18a31aaf824065bd9bbe2d3665124499379.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f88ca1c2914a9c4e4fc26e933b445488cd864f9329c3258cac947528c0765ba7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮前友花","creatorId":"vndb:s5814","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5814","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5814","name":"宮前 友花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:68258:93956:48864:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c8170","characterName":"沢渡 琴音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"charac